        "In Shirkah al 'Inan, a partner is Wakil (agent) but NOT Kafil (indemnifier/surety) of other partners - he is not liable to indemnify an outsider for another partner's loss during agency, though local 'Urf (custom) can modify this default.",
        "A partner contributing extra services beyond ordinary partnership duties (e.g. accounting) can, with mutual consent, receive a profit share greater than his pure capital-ratio entitlement."
